WEBVTT

00:18:30.746 --> 00:18:35.038
A yes, born of a lifelong correspondence
with your own heart.

00:18:36.163 --> 00:18:40.954
And in seeing yourself. Because
in seeing yourself,

00:18:41.663 --> 00:18:47.913
you are also able to see others to.
The only sustainable way forward.

00:18:49.038 --> 00:18:57.371
In a fragile, beautiful world. So,
Warner and thank you, thank.